{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/rkpurchasekit\/subscriptions"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PurchaseKit"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Subscriptions"},"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/Subscriptions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An entitlement check answers one question: may the customer use the feature right now? A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subscription app usually needs more - whether the subscription will renew, whether a payment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is failing, which offer this customer may see. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/SubscriptionOffer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchaseOptions","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" cover that ground."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The examples use one subscription group:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let groupID = \"com.myapp.subscriptions.premium\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The group ID is configured in App Store Connect and available as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreProduct\/subscriptionGroupID","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Read the subscription status","level":2,"anchor":"Read-the-subscription-status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesProtocol\/subscriptionStatus(inGroup:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns the status that matters most for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when the customer has never subscribed to it:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let status = try await PurchasesManager.shared.subscriptionStatus(inGroup: groupID)","","if let status {","    print(status.state.rawValue, status.isActive)","    print(\"Renews:\", status.willAutoRenew, \"on\", status.renewalDate ?? .distantPast)","    print(\"Into:\", status.autoRenewProductID ?? \"-\")","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/isActive"},{"type":"text","text":" follows the App Store’s rule for access: subscribed or in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grace period. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/transaction"},{"type":"text","text":" is the latest transaction behind the status,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreTransaction\/expirationDate"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreTransaction\/offer-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" describe the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"period."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/autoRenewProductID","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" differs from the transaction’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreTransaction\/productID","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the customer has scheduled an upgrade, downgrade or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"crossgrade that takes effect at the next renewal.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Family Sharing a customer can hold more than one status in a group. Read them all with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/subscriptionStatuses(inGroup:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Show billing problems","anchor":"Show-billing-problems","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When a renewal payment fails, the App Store retries it for up to 60 days. If you enabled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Billing Grace Period in App Store Connect, the customer keeps access for the first part of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that window.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["switch status.state {","case .inGracePeriod:","    \/\/ Still has access. Ask them to fix the payment method before it ends.","    showBanner(\"Update your payment method to keep Premium\",","               until: status.gracePeriodExpirationDate)","case .inBillingRetryPeriod:","    \/\/ Access is gone, but the subscription can still recover.","    showBanner(\"Your payment did not go through\")","default:","    break","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS and visionOS, send the customer to the system’s subscription screen with the manager’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"showManageSubscriptions(in:groupID:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", passing the window scene that presents it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/expirationReason-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" says why an expired subscription ended - turned off","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the customer, a billing error, a declined price increase, or a product no longer sold - so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the win-back message can match the reason.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Check introductory-offer eligibility","anchor":"Check-introductory-offer-eligibility","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreProduct\/introductoryOffer"},{"type":"text","text":" describes the trial or intro price that is configured; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not say whether this customer may have it. A customer who has already redeemed an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"introductory offer in the group is not eligible again:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let eligible = await PurchasesManager.shared.isEligibleForIntroOffer(inGroup: groupID)","","if eligible, let intro = product.introductoryOffer, intro.paymentMode == .freeTrial {","    buyButton.title = \"Start free trial\"","} else {","    buyButton.title = \"Subscribe for \\(product.displayPrice)\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your server decides eligibility itself - for example, one trial per account across"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"devices and Apple IDs - it can sign that decision. Pass the signed value in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchaseOptions\/introductoryOfferEligibilityJWS","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the App Store applies it instead of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own check."}]},{"anchor":"Sell-a-promotional-offer","text":"Sell a promotional offer","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Promotional offers are for existing or lapsed subscribers, and each purchase needs a signature","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that only your server can produce. The app never holds the In-App Purchase key:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app asks your server for a signature for the offer it wants to present, sending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/SubscriptionOffer\/id"},{"type":"text","text":" and the product ID."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The server checks the customer may have the offer and signs a compact JWS with your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In-App Purchase key, using the App Store Server Library.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app passes the JWS in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchaseOptions\/promotionalOffer-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["guard let offer = product.promotionalOffers.first, let offerID = offer.id else { return }","","let jws = try await api.signPromotionalOffer(offerID: offerID, productID: product.productID)","let options = PurchaseOptions(","    appAccountToken: user.id,","    promotionalOffer: PurchaseOptions.PromotionalOffer(offerID: offerID, compactJWS: jws)",")","let (_, transaction) = try await PurchasesManager.shared","    .purchase(productID: product.productID, options: options)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A rejected offer throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesError\/Code-swift.struct\/ineligibleForOffer"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidOffer"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Win-back-lapsed-subscribers","text":"Win back lapsed subscribers","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Win-back offers are configured in App Store Connect for customers whose subscription has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ended. StoreKit decides eligibility itself, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreProduct\/winBackOffers"},{"type":"text","text":" lists only the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers this customer can redeem right now. Unlike promotional offers, they need no signature:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let product = try await PurchasesManager.shared","    .requestProducts(includingCache: false)","    .first { $0.productID == \"com.myapp.sub.premium.monthly\" }","","if let product, let offer = product.winBackOffers.first, let offerID = offer.id {","    let options = PurchaseOptions(winBackOfferID: offerID)","    _ = try await PurchasesManager.shared.purchase(productID: product.productID, options: options)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Fetch with ","type":"text"},{"code":"includingCache: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before showing a win-back screen: eligibility is evaluated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when StoreKit returns the product, and a cached product can be stale. An ID the product does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not offer throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesError\/Code-swift.struct\/offerNotFound","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" before the purchase sheet appears.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Observe-status-changes","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Observe status changes"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Renewals, expirations, billing failures and plan changes happen while the app is not running"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a purchase. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/subscriptionStatusUpdates","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" delivers each new status:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Task {","    for await status in PurchasesManager.shared.subscriptionStatusUpdates {","        await MainActor.run { model.apply(status) }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/purchasedProducts","type":"reference"},{"text":", every access returns a fresh stream and events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not replayed, so read the current state with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesProtocol\/subscriptionStatus(inGroup:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" when a subscriber starts.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Verify-on-your-server","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Verify on your server"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decisions with money attached belong on a server. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/renewalInfoJWS"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreTransaction\/jwsRepresentation","type":"reference"},{"text":" are the App Store’s signed forms; send those rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than the decoded fields, which only say what the device read.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Read renewal state, react to billing problems, and sell introductory, promotional and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"win-back offers."}],"references":{"doc://purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit/documentation/RKPurchaseKit/PurchaseOptions":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchaseOptions","url":"\/documentation\/rkpurchasekit\/purchaseoptions","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PurchaseOptions","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PurchaseOptions","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PurchaseOptions","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Everything a purchase can carry besides the product: an account token, a quantity, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offer, and sandbox switches.","type":"text"}]},"doc://purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit/documentation/RKPurchaseKit/PurchasesError/Code-swift.struct/invalidOffer":{"url":"\/documentation\/rkpurchasekit\/purchaseserror\/code-swift.struct\/invalidoffer","title":"invalidOffer","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"tex